<package name="XULA-DIP37">
<description>&lt;b&gt;XuLA3 breadboard header, 0.800 x 2.750 in&lt;/b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Two rows 0.700 in apart, so the pins land in breadboard columns C and H and leave A, B, I and J free. 24 positions per row on 0.100 in; 38 fitted, 10 bare. Board 20.32 x 69.85 mm. The pins stop at x=59.69; the last 8.89 mm carries no grid position at all and is reserved for the Pmod header and its signals.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
